canonical-prompt.txt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Create one finished transparent PNG game sprite atlas, 4 columns by 2 rows, landscape 2:1. Exactly eight isolated full-body sprites of ONE new character, ONIX, not the rabbit in the reference. The reference is STYLE ONLY: maintain the painterly 2D Brasa gouache illustration, earthy materials, clean dark contours, fine cloth texture, warm restrained rim light, readable adult animal fighter at three heads tall. No 3D sheen or photorealism.
ONIX is a lean athletic adult BLACK DOMESTIC CAT, small feline muzzle, triangular ears WITHOUT tufts, long slender black tail, short jet-black fur with cool charcoal highlights. Very legible warm YELLOW eyes with feline pupils, black nose, feline whiskers. Not a lynx, panther, wolf or human. Wear the SAME sleeveless dark petrol-green vest, ochre cloth waist belt and sash, ivory paw/wrist wraps and one small copper brooch in all eight poses. Bare short-furred feline hindpaws, dark simple lower trousers. No weapons, no hats.
All sprites face screen RIGHT in the same side-three-quarter view, same character scale, same virtual ground line. Each sprite sits entirely inside its own equal grid cell, with wide transparent gutters at least 10% cell width on all sides. Standing body uses only 70–74% of cell height. Keep the long tail compactly curved inside the cell; no tail reaching a neighbor. Hands anatomically feline, forearm connected to shoulder through visible elbow and wrist, natural size, no inflated fist or arm from neck.
Read row-major:
1 idle guard, relaxed ready stance;
2 same idle gently breathing, slight chest rise;
3 windup, rear paw drawn back, torso rotates;
4 punch: controlled straight lead paw toward right, elbow softly bent, shoulder visibly joined to torso, other paw guards chest, weight grounded;
5 hit: small backward recoil, eyes still readable;
6 dodge: low crouch, chin tucked, same physical scale;
7 victory: modest bent fist at head height, smiling feline, full tail and feet visible;
8 defeat: lying on side near the same virtual baseline, relaxed limbs, head on wrapped paw, same body size, no blood.
Transparent background: export genuine RGBA PNG with alpha 0 outside characters. No floor, cast shadow, background, checkerboard pixels, labels, text, letters, numbers, grid lines, visual effects or extra props. Every ear, tail, paw and sash must be fully inside its cell, with generous empty space. Exactly 8 complete poses.
